{"name":"-47-4-1","beats":[{"sprites":[],"ops":[{"type":"background","value":"black","raw":"BIN"},{"type":"blackscreenOn","value":"0,10","raw":"黑屏1"},{"type":"bgm","value":"BGM_Empty","raw":"BGM"}],"speaker":null,"narrator":false,"pages":[]},{"sprites":[],"ops":[{"type":"bgm","value":"BGM_Brain","raw":"BGM"},{"type":"background","value":"yongchi2021","raw":"BIN"},{"type":"blackscreenOff","raw":"黑屏2"}],"speaker":null,"narrator":false,"pages":[{"spans":[{"text":"On the deck."}]}]},{"sprites":[{"prefab":"MDR","expression":4,"shown":true,"side":"left","tags":{}}],"ops":[],"speaker":"MDR","narrator":false,"pages":[{"spans":[{"text":"Hm? I remember it was in this direction?"}]}]},{"sprites":[{"prefab":"Welrod","expression":2,"shown":true,"side":"left","tags":{}}],"ops":[],"speaker":"Welrod MkII","narrator":false,"pages":[{"spans":[{"text":"There's no sign of the security droids. How strange."}]}]},{"sprites":[{"prefab":"Lewis","expression":9,"shown":true,"side":"left","tags":{}}],"ops":[],"speaker":"Lewis","narrator":false,"pages":[{"spans":[{"text":"Look! By the pool!"}]}]},{"sprites":[{"prefab":"MDR","expression":4,"shown":true,"side":"left","tags":{}}],"ops":[],"speaker":"MDR","narrator":false,"pages":[{"spans":[{"text":"The pool? "}]},{"spans":[{"text":"Oh, a security droid!"}]}]},{"sprites":[],"ops":[],"speaker":null,"narrator":false,"pages":[{"spans":[{"text":"The Griffin Dolls immediately go on alert, but the droid is merely lying prone on the side of the pool, half of its body submerged in the water, utterly still."}]}]},{"sprites":[{"prefab":"MDR","expression":4,"shown":true,"side":"left","tags":{}}],"ops":[],"speaker":"MDR","narrator":false,"pages":[{"spans":[{"text":"Is it...taking a dip?"}]}]},{"sprites":[{"prefab":"M200","expression":4,"shown":true,"side":"left","tags":{}}],"ops":[],"speaker":"M200","narrator":false,"pages":[{"spans":[{"text":"Hold on, come take a look at this!"}]}]},{"sprites":[],"ops":[],"speaker":null,"narrator":false,"pages":[{"spans":[{"