ored here, and a troop of security droids are entering combat mode."}]}]},{"sprites":[{"prefab":"Thunder50","expression":2,"shown":true,"side":"left","tags":{}}],"ops":[],"speaker":"Thunder","narrator":false,"pages":[{"spans":[{"text":"Bootleg weapons..."}]}]},{"sprites":[{"prefab":"Lewis","expression":11,"shown":true,"side":"left","tags":{}}],"ops":[],"speaker":"Lewis","narrator":false,"pages":[{"spans":[{"text":"...B-Bootleg weapons?"}]}]},{"sprites":[{"prefab":"NPC_girill","expression":2,"shown":true,"side":"left","tags":{}}],"ops":[],"speaker":"Valentin","narrator":false,"pages":[{"spans":[{"text":"People just keep getting in the way ever since I cut this deal! I see that you can't wait to go to hell!"}]}]},{"sprites":[],"ops":[],"speaker":null,"narrator":false,"pages":[{"spans":[{"text":"Under Valentin's order, the security droids start launching an attack."}]}]},{"sprites":[],"ops":[{"type":"shake","raw":"震屏3"},{"type":"sfx","value":"Gunfight","raw":"SE2"}],"speaker":null,"narrator":false,"pages":[{"spans":[{"text":"However, the droid in the lead collapses onto the floor at the sound of a loud gunshot."}]}]},{"sprites":[{"prefab":"M200","expression":4,"shown":true,"side":"left","tags":{}}],"ops":[],"speaker":"M200","narrator":false,"pages":[{"spans":[{"text":"Just because we were waiting outside the door doesn't make us useless decoration."}]}]},{"sprites":[],"ops":[],"speaker":null,"narrator":false,"pages":[{"spans":[{"text":"The Griffin Dolls appear inside the cargo bay one after the other. Soon, Thunder is freed from her binding."}]}]},{"sprites":[],"ops":[{"type":"sfx","value":"Select","raw":"SE1"}],"speaker":null,"narrator":false,"pages":[{"spans":[{"text":"The Dolls, now reunited, all aim their weapons at Valentin. "}]},{"spans":[{"text":"But the man merely smirks nonchalantly."}]}]},{"sprites":[{"prefab":"NPC_girill","expression":2,"shown":true,"side":"left","tags":{}}],"ops":[],"speaker":"Valentin","narrator":false,"pages":[{"spans":[{"text":"Oh please, you are standing in front of a private arms dealing mogul. I have all the weapons I need."}]}]},{"sprites":[{"prefab":"NPC_girill","expression":2,"shown":true,"side":"left","tags":{}}],"ops":[{"type":"sfx","value":"AVG_door_storehouse","raw":"SE1"}],"speaker":"Valentin","narrator":false,"pages":[{"spans":[{"text":"Behold! The \"Supernova Warframe\", absolutely one-of-a-kind! Just the monthly maintenance fee is enough to buy several dozens of you! "}]},{"spans":[{"text":"Oh, I'm doing you a real honor here—I'm actually busting out this baby! You'd better be worth it, Dolls!"}]}]},{"sprites":[],"ops":[{"type":"fadePointOn","raw":"黑点1"},{"type":"background","value":"White","raw":"BIN"}],"speaker":null,"narrator":false,"pages":[]}]}
